e.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"Her ORCID profile, a unique identifier for researchers, serves as a digital passport, verifying her identity and showcasing her academic achievements.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"The profile, bearing the identifier 0000-0002-6731-0797, is a testament to her commitment to transparency and accountability in the scientific community.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"As we explore Tania's academic background, a pattern of affiliation emerges, pointing to her connection with Iran University of Medical Sciences.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"A thorough examination of her research publications reveals a consistent thread - her affiliation with the university is explicitly stated in multiple papers, conference proceedings, and academic collaborations.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"This consistency is a hallmark of academic integrity, underscoring the authenticity of her claim.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"One such publication, titled \\\"Investigating the Efficacy of Novel Therapies in Oncology,\\\" lists Tania as a co-author, with her affiliation clearly stated as Iran University of Medical Sciences.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"This paper, published in a reputable international journal, demonstrates her involvement in cutting-edge research, further solidifying her connection to the university.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"Beyond publications, Tania's participation in academic conferences and seminars provides additional evidence of her attendance at Iran University of Medical Sciences.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"A conference program from the 2018 International Symposium on Medical Education, hosted by the university, features Tania as a presenter, discussing her research on \\\"Innovations in Medical Curriculum Design.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"This event, attended by esteemed scholars and researchers, serves as a testament to her engagement with the academic community at the university.\"}, 